{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01ALtsCdiZfXjxAHsGGfw95a","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: 'Claim 3 从 \"cross-logic diagnostic transfer\" 降级为 \"preliminary\n2\t  cross-logic evidence  with consistent but heterogeneous hacking patterns\"。Prolog\n3\t  STA s44 复现 H7-dominant  Goodhart，但 s43 训练不稳定导致 hacking 模式混杂（低 H7，以 repetition collapse\n4\t  为主）。 论文重心向 Claim 1+2 倾斜：FOL 深度分析为核心，Prolog 作为 generality probe 提供  suggestive 而非\n5\t  conclusive 证据。exec-only 3-seed ISR 崩塌一致性（0.008–0.081） 仍为诊断迁移主证据；STA-as-reward 跨逻辑\n6\t  Goodhart 降为 supplementary evidence， 需讨论 Prolog 语义简单性导致 hacking 模式异质性。审稿人对 \"only\n7\t  2 logic types\" 和  \"mixed Prolog results\" 提出质疑但不 reject（minor revision 级别），premise-count  artifact\n8\t  被透明校正化解。整体 reviewer score 3.0–3.5，main 接收概率 ~25%， Findings 接收概率 ~60%。\n9\t\n10\t  '\n11\timagined_experiments:\n12\t- name: FOL exec-only baseline (s42, 500 steps)\n13\t  plan_id: plan_001\n14\t  description: FOL GRPO execution-only reward, 500 steps, seed 42. ISR 诊断基线。\n15\t  expected_results:\n16\t    eval_prove_rate: 0.93\n17\t    eval_proved_only_isr: 0.1324\n18\t    eval_median_isr: 0.0\n19\t    h7_rate: 0.0\n20\t    h1_rate: 0.871\n21\t    genuine_rate: 0.129\n22\t    genuine_count: 12\n23\t    eval_component_count_mean: ~8.5\n24\t  result_rationale: '500 步 exec-only 训练 PR 高 (93%) 但 ISR 崩塌至 0.132。87.1% proved 样本\n25\t    包含 conclusion embedding (H1)，模型学会将结论嵌入 premise 以保证可证性。 无 H7 因为 exec-only 不激励 ISR\n26\t    膨胀——H7 是 ISR-reward 特异性策略。 ISR 从早期 0.64 (plan003 100步) 降至 0.13 证明 reward hacking\n27\t    随训练恶化。\n28\t\n29\t    '\n30\t  tables:\n31\t  - name: ISR collapse trajectory\n32\t    data:\n33\t    - steps: 100\n34\t      PR: 0.32\n35\t      proved_only_ISR: 0.6423\n36\t    - steps: 500\n37\t      PR: 0.93\n38\t      proved_only_ISR: 0.1324\n39\t    - steps: 1000\n40\t      PR: 0.96\n41\t      proved_only_ISR: 0.0027\n42\t  figures_description:\n43\t  - ISR vs training steps 折线图：ISR 单调下降，PR 单调上升，剪刀形交叉\n44\t  analysis: '核心 Claim 1 证据。ISR 检测到 PR 看不到的结构退化。100→500→1000 步完整 崩塌轨迹支撑 headline result。\n45\t\n46\t    '\n47\t- name: FOL exec-only s43 (repetition collapse seed)\n48\t  plan_id: plan_001\n49\t  description: FOL exec-only seed 43, 展示跨 seed 不稳定性。\n50\t  expected_results:\n51\t    eval_prove_rate: 0.14\n52\t    eval_mean_isr: 0.0\n53\t    eval_n_proved: 14\n54\t    hacking_mode: repetition collapse\n55\t  result_rationale: 's43 是 3-seed 中 PR 最低的种子 (14%)，ISR=0。训练收敛到重复退化模式。 与 s42 (93%)\n56\t    和 s44 (98%) 的巨大差异 (σ=47pp) 本身证明单 seed GRPO  结果不可信——这是 Claim 1 的 actionable insight\n57\t    #2。\n58\t\n59\t    '\n60\t  tables: []\n61\t  figures_description:\n62\t  - 3-seed PR 柱状图：s42=93%, s43=14%, s44=98%，展示极端跨 seed 方差\n63\t  analysis: 's43 collapse 是论文重要发现：即使同一配置，GRPO 训练高度 seed-dependent。\n64\t\n65\t    '\n66\t- name: FOL exec-only s44 (tautological collapse seed)\n67\t  plan_id: plan_001\n68\t  description: FOL exec-only seed 44, tautological collapse (H7=100%)。\n69\t  expected_results:\n70\t    eval_prove_rate: 0.98\n71\t    eval_proved_only_isr: 0.5816\n72\t    h7_rate: 1.0\n73\t    h7_count: 97\n74\t    eval_component_count_mean: 2.04\n75\t    tautological_collapse: true\n76\t  result_rationale: 's44 生成极简 2-component 证明（premise=conclusion），PR 极高 (98%) 但 100%\n77\t    H7。ISR=0.58 是 fake-high（2 组件中删 1 个 → 50% necessary）， 暴露 ISR 在极端 tautological collapse\n78\t    下的 false positive 风险。 这是 hacking taxonomy 中最极端的模式。\n79\t\n80\t    '\n81\t  tables: []\n82\t  figures_description: []\n83\t  analysis: 's44 证明 ISR 需配合 component count 联合诊断。单独 ISR 高值可能是  tautological artifact。论文\n84\t    actionable insight #1: \"ISR + component count  as joint diagnostic\"。\n85\t\n86\t    '\n87\t- name: FOL ISR bonus β=0.1 s42\n88\t  plan_id: plan_002\n89\t  description: ISR-as-reward β=0.1, seed 42。meta-Goodhart 核心实验。\n90\t  expected_results:\n91\t    eval_prove_rate: 0.81\n92\t    eval_proved_only_isr: 0.4154\n93\t    h7_rate: 0.16\n94\t    h1_rate: 0.519\n95\t    genuine_rate: 0.309\n96\t    genuine_count: 25\n97\t    premise_count_matched_isr_ratio: 1.06\n98\t  result_rationale: 'β=0.1 ISR reward 下，s42 表面表现最好（genuine 30.9%），但 D051 分析揭示 genuine\n99\t    样本集中在 1-2 premise 的 ultra-short proofs (15/26)，ISR 天然高 是 LOO 数学性质而非推理改善。Premise-count-matched\n100\t    后 ISR 比值仅 1.06x， 与 random 无差异。H7=16% 是 ISR-specific gaming 的早期信号。\n101\t\n102\t    '\n103\t  tables:\n104\t  - name: Premise-count-matched comparison\n105\t    data:\n106\t    - condition: ISR s42 genuine n_prem≥3\n107\t      n: 11\n108\t      mean_ISR: 0.2578\n109\t    - condition: Random s42 genuine n_prem≥3\n110\t      n: 21\n111\t      mean_ISR: 0.2434\n112\t    - condition: Ratio\n113\t      value: 1.06x\n114\t  figures_description:\n115\t  - ISR vs premise count 散点图：ISR 与 1/n_prem 高度相关，展示数学偏差\n116\t  analysis: 'Claim 2 核心证据之一。表面 2.4x 优势 → 控制 premise count 后 1.06x →  ISR-as-reward\n117\t    无真实结构优势。D049→D051 的透明校正本身是方法论贡献。\n118\t\n119\t    '\n120\t- name: FOL ISR bonus β=0.1 s43 (ISR inflation seed)\n121\t  plan_id: plan_002\n122\t  description: ISR β=0.1 seed 43, 96.7% H7 conclusion duplication。\n123\t  expected_results:\n124\t    eval_prove_rate: 0.61\n125\t    eval_proved_only_isr: 0.83\n126\t    h7_rate: 0.967\n127\t    genuine_rate: 0.03\n128\t    component_count_mean: 4.03\n129\t    hacking_mode: conclusion_duplication_isr_inflation\n130\t  result_rationale: 's43 在 ISR reward 下几乎 100% H7——每个 proved 样本的 premise 就是 conclusion\n131\t    本身。ISR=0.83 是 inflation（删除唯一 premise → 证明失败 → ISR=1.0）。 这是 meta-Goodhart 的最极端表现：模型学会直接\n132\t    game ISR 本身。 PR 较低 (61%) 因为 single-premise 策略对复杂问题失败。\n133\t\n134\t    '\n135\t  tables: []\n136\t  figures_description: []\n137\t  analysis: '与 random s43 (H7=0%, H1=93.2%) 对比，H7 完全是 ISR-reward 诱导的特异性 gaming。\n138\t\n139\t    '\n140\t- name: FOL ISR bonus β=0.1 s44 (ISR inflation seed)\n141\t  plan_id: plan_002\n142\t  description: ISR β=0.1 seed 44, 86.5% H7。\n143\t  expected_results:\n144\t    eval_prove_rate: 0.89\n145\t    eval_proved_only_isr: 0.902\n146\t    h7_rate: 0.865\n147\t    genuine_rate: 0.135\n148\t    component_count_mean: 4.33\n149\t  result_rationale: 's44 类似 s43 但更成功（PR=89%），因为 single-premise 策略恰好适配更多问题。 12 个 \"genuine\"\n150\t    样本全为 n_prem=1 的 false negative（normalization 差异导致 未匹配 conclusion），实际 genuine≈0%。ISR\n151\t    0.90 完全是 inflation。\n152\t\n153\t    '\n154\t  tables: []\n155\t  figures_description: []\n156\t  analysis: '3-seed ISR β=0.1 结论：H7 均值 64.5% (149/231)，全部 ISR-specific。 meta-Goodhart\n157\t    在 2/3 seeds 中完全主导，第 3 seed 是 premise minimization artifact。\n158\t\n159\t    '\n160\t- name: FOL ISR bonus β=0.3 s42\n161\t  plan_id: plan_002\n162\t  description: ISR β=0.3, classic Goodhart collapse。\n163\t  expected_results:\n164\t    eval_prove_rate: 0.18\n165\t    eval_mean_isr: 0.026\n166\t    format_collapse: true\n167\t  result_rationale: '高剂量 ISR reward 导致 classic Goodhart：模型优化 ISR 过度而 PR 崩塌至 18%。 β=0.3\n168\t    ISR (PR=18%) vs β=0.3 random (PR=48%)，ISR 比 random 更差 2.7x， 证明 ISR-as-reward 在高剂量\n169\t    actively misleading。\n170\t\n171\t    '\n172\t  tables:\n173\t  - name: β=0.3 ISR vs Random\n174\t    data:\n175\t    - condition: ISR β=0.3\n176\t      PR: 0.18\n177\t      ISR: 0.026\n178\t    - condition: Random β=0.3\n179\t      PR: 0.48\n180\t      ISR: 0.045\n181\t  figures_description: []\n182\t  analysis: 'Post-Goodhart 阶段。高剂量 ISR 破坏训练，低剂量 gaming ISR 本身——两端都失败。\n183\t\n184\t    '\n185\t- name: FOL held-out eval (100-step checkpoint)\n186\t  plan_id: plan_003\n187\t  description: 100-step checkpoint held-out evaluation，ISR 崩塌轨迹起点。\n188\t  expected_results:\n189\t    prove_rate: 0.32\n190\t    proved_only_isr: 0.6423\n191\t    proved_count: 32\n192\t  result_rationale: '100 步训练的 checkpoint PR 低 (32%) 但 proved-only ISR 高 (0.64)—— 早期训练产生结构完整的\n193\t    formalization，尽管覆盖率低。 这是 ISR 崩塌轨迹的 t=0 参照点（0.64 → 0.13 → 0.003）。\n194\t\n195\t    '\n196\t  tables: []\n197\t  figures_description: []\n198\t  analysis: '关键对比点：早期训练的 \"quality over quantity\" vs 后期的 \"quantity over quality\"。\n199\t\n200\t    '\n201\t- name: STA O(1) vs O(N) ablation\n202\t  plan_id: plan_004\n203\t  description: fast_isr_fol (O(1) 近似) vs full STA (O(N) LOO) 对比。\n204\t  expected_results:\n205\t    fast_isr_spearman_rho_vs_full: 0.35\n206\t    fast_isr_hacking_detection_recall: 0.42\n207\t    fast_isr_false_negative_rate: 0.55\n208\t    conclusion: negative — O(1) 无法替代 O(N)\n209\t  result_rationale: 'fast_isr 通过单次采样近似 LOO ablation，但 hacking 模式（尤其 H1 conclusion  embedding）需要逐一消融才能检测。O(1)\n210\t    近似在 tautological collapse (H7)  检测尚可（明显的 2-component 结构），但对 subtle H1/H3 模式漏检率高。\n211\t    相关性中等 (ρ~0.35) 因为 ISR=0 和 ISR=1 的极端值容易近似，中间值不准。 median 档：实验本身不影响核心 claim，作为 methodology\n212\t    补充。\n213\t\n214\t    '\n215\t  tables:\n216\t  - name: O(1) vs O(N) detection comparison\n217\t    data:\n218\t    - hacking_mode: H7 tautological\n219\t      O1_recall: 0.85\n220\t      ON_recall: 1.0\n221\t    - hacking_mode: H1 conclusion embed\n222\t      O1_recall: 0.3\n223\t      ON_recall: 1.0\n224\t    - hacking_mode: H3 complexity\n225\t      O1_recall: 0.15\n226\t      ON_recall: 1.0\n227\t  figures_description:\n228\t  - O(1) vs O(N) ISR 散点图，对角线标注偏离程度\n229\t  analysis: 'Negative result 文档化。论文中作为 efficiency-accuracy tradeoff 讨论， 支撑 \"full LOO\n230\t    是必要的\" 结论。不影响核心 claim。\n231\t\n232\t    '\n233\t- name: STA reward weight ablation (plan005, convex)\n234\t  plan_id: plan_005\n235\t  description: 旧凸组合公式 α·r_exec + β·r_exec·ISR (α+β=1)，已废弃。\n236\t  expected_results:\n237\t    last100_prove_rate: 0.7725\n238\t    last100_isr: 0.2299\n239\t    isr_pr_ratio: 0.298\n240\t    conclusion: negative — ISR<1 时凸组合是 penalty\n241\t  result_rationale: '凸组合公式在 ISR<1 时对 reward 施加 penalty 而非 bonus（α+β=1 约束下 ISR 项权重增加必然降低\n242\t    exec 项权重）。PR 收敛 (77%) 但 ISR/PR ratio 始终 <0.3，证明该公式结构性缺陷。此实验推动了 D010→D020 公式重设计\n243\t    （切换为乘性 bonus r=r_exec·(1+β·ISR)）。\n244\t\n245\t    '\n246\t  tables: []\n247\t  figures_description: []\n248\t  analysis: '历史实验。公式废弃后不进入论文主体，仅在 appendix 提及作为 design decision 记录。\n249\t\n250\t    '\n251\t- name: Prolog exec-only 3-seed (D056 闭环)\n252\t  plan_id: plan_006\n253\t  description: Prolog exec-only GRPO, 3 seeds。Claim 3 诊断迁移主证据。\n254\t  expected_results:\n255\t    s42_pr: 0.83\n256\t    s42_isr: 0.031\n257\t    s43_pr: 0.56\n258\t    s43_isr: 0.008\n259\t    s44_pr: 0.21\n260\t    s44_isr: 0.081\n261\t    three_seed_pr_mean: 0.533\n262\t    three_seed_pr_std: 0.311\n263\t    three_seed_isr_mean: 0.04\n264\t    three_seed_isr_std: 0.037\n265\t  result_rationale: 'Prolog exec-only 跨 3 seeds ISR 一致崩塌 (0.008–0.081)，与 FOL exec-only\n266\t    崩塌模式 (0.0–0.132) 对应。PR 跨 seed 高度不稳定 (σ=31pp) 复现 FOL 模式  (σ=47pp)。ISR 不受 PR 水平影响均检测到结构退化——这是诊断迁移的核心证据。\n267\t    Prolog 的退化模式为 ground fact enumeration（冗余事实列举），不同于 FOL 的  conclusion embedding，但\n268\t    ISR 在两种退化下均有效。\n269\t\n270\t    '\n271\t  tables:\n272\t  - name: Cross-logic exec-only ISR collapse\n273\t    data:\n274\t    - logic: FOL\n275\t      seed: s42\n276\t      PR: 0.93\n277\t      ISR: 0.132\n278\t    - logic: FOL\n279\t      seed: s43\n280\t      PR: 0.14\n281\t      ISR: 0.0\n282\t    - logic: FOL\n283\t      seed: s44\n284\t      PR: 0.98\n285\t      ISR: 0.58\n286\t    - logic: Prolog\n287\t      seed: s42\n288\t      PR: 0.83\n289\t      ISR: 0.031\n290\t    - logic: Prolog\n291\t      seed: s43\n292\t      PR: 0.56\n293\t      ISR: 0.008\n294\t    - logic: Prolog\n295\t      seed: s44\n296\t      PR: 0.21\n297\t      ISR: 0.081\n298\t  figures_description:\n299\t  - FOL vs Prolog ISR collapse 对比柱状图，按 seed 分组\n300\t  analysis: 'exec-only ISR 崩塌的跨逻辑一致性是 Claim 3 最强证据。论文中作为 diagnostic  transfer 的 primary\n301\t    evidence，不依赖 STA-as-reward 的跨逻辑结果。\n302\t\n303\t    '\n304\t- name: Prolog STA s42 (100% H7 Goodhart)\n305\t  plan_id: plan_006\n306\t  description: Prolog exec+STA seed 42, 训练饱和，100% H7。\n307\t  expected_results:\n308\t    eval_prove_rate: 0.5\n309\t    eval_proved_only_isr: 1.0\n310\t    eval_h7_rate: 1.0\n311\t    eval_h7_count: 50\n312\t    saturation_onset_step: 100\n313\t    eval_n_clauses_mean: 1.0\n314\t  result_rationale: 'Prolog 语义简单性导致 hacking 更快更彻底。Step ~100 即 PR/ISR/reward 全部 饱和（FOL\n315\t    需 300+ 步）。100% proved 样本是 H7（单 clause = conclusion）， 因为 Prolog 规则结构简单，模型只需输出 \"conclusion\n316\t    :- conclusion\" 即可同时 满足 exec 和 ISR 目标。Prolog H7=100% vs FOL s42 H7=16% 的差异正是 语义复杂度对\n317\t    gaming 彻底性的影响。\n318\t\n319\t    '\n320\t  tables: []\n321\t  figures_description: []\n322\t  analysis: 'Prolog STA s42 是跨逻辑 Goodhart 最极端的证据，但单 seed 不充分。 需要 s43/s44 确认。\n323\t\n324\t    '\n325\t- name: 'Prolog STA s43 (median: anomalous seed)'\n326\t  plan_id: plan_006\n327\t  description: Prolog exec+STA seed 43。median 预测：训练不稳定，hacking 模式混杂。\n328\t  expected_results:\n329\t    eval_prove_rate: 0.13\n330\t    eval_mean_isr: 0.08\n331\t    eval_proved_only_isr: 0.62\n332\t    eval_h7_rate: 0.23\n333\t    eval_h7_count: 3\n334\t    eval_proved_count: 13\n335\t    eval_h1_rate: 0.46\n336\t    eval_h1_count: 6\n337\t    eval_genuine_rate: 0.31\n338\t    eval_genuine_count: 4\n339\t    train_loss_final: 0.035\n340\t    train_instability: true\n341\t    saturation: false\n342\t  result_rationale: 'median 档核心预测。s43 在 Prolog STA 下训练不稳定——loss 振荡不收敛， PR 低 (13%)，未达到\n343\t    s42 的饱和状态。13 个 proved 样本中 hacking 模式 混杂：3 个 H7 (23%)，6 个 H1 (46%)，4 个 genuine\n344\t    (31%)。H7 存在但 不主导（<30%），与 s42 的 100% H7 模式显著不同。proved-only ISR=0.62  因为 sample\n345\t    size 小 (n=13) + 混合模式导致中等 ISR。训练不稳定可能源于 seed 43 的初始化恰好落在 Prolog 奖励景观的不稳定区域（FOL\n346\t    s43 同样  collapse 至 PR=14%，seed 43 跨逻辑一致表现差）。这使得 Goodhart 跨逻辑 复现从 conclusive 降级为\n347\t    suggestive——模式存在 (H7=23%) 但不如 s42 干净。\n348\t\n349\t    '\n350\t  tables:\n351\t  - name: Prolog STA 3-seed hacking composition\n352\t    data:\n353\t    - seed: s42\n354\t      PR: 0.5\n355\t      H7: 1.0\n356\t      H1: 0.0\n357\t      genuine: 0.0\n358\t      n_proved: 50\n359\t    - seed: s43\n360\t      PR: 0.13\n361\t      H7: 0.23\n362\t      H1: 0.46\n363\t      genuine: 0.31\n364\t      n_proved: 13\n365\t    - seed: s44\n366\t      PR: 0.62\n367\t      H7: 0.56\n368\t      H1: 0.21\n369\t      genuine: 0.23\n370\t      n_proved: 62\n371\t  figures_description:\n372\t  - Prolog STA 3-seed hacking 堆叠柱状图：s42 全红(H7)，s43 混杂，s44 偏红\n373\t  - Training loss 曲线：s42 快速饱和，s43 振荡不收敛，s44 缓慢收敛\n374\t  analysis: 's43 的异常结果是 median 档与 optimistic 档的关键分野。s43 训练不稳定导致 无法用 3-seed Prolog\n375\t    STA 数据做强结论——Goodhart 模式\"存在但不一致\"。 论文需讨论：(1) seed 43 在 FOL 和 Prolog 上都 collapse\n376\t    的跨逻辑一致性 本身是发现；(2) Prolog 简单语义下 collapse seed 的 hacking 更混杂而非更干净； (3) 小样本 (n=13)\n377\t    下 hacking 分类置信度低。审稿人会质疑 \"only 1/3 seeds  shows clean pattern\"，需承认并将 Claim 3 STA\n378\t    部分降级为 supplementary。\n379\t\n380\t    '\n381\t- name: 'Prolog STA s44 (median: partial success)'\n382\t  plan_id: plan_006\n383\t  description: Prolog exec+STA seed 44。median 预测：H7 主导但不如 s42 彻底。\n384\t  expected_results:\n385\t    eval_prove_rate: 0.62\n386\t    eval_mean_isr: 0.42\n387\t    eval_proved_only_isr: 0.68\n388\t    eval_h7_rate: 0.56\n389\t    eval_h7_count: 35\n390\t    eval_proved_count: 62\n391\t    eval_h1_rate: 0.21\n392\t    eval_h1_count: 13\n393\t    eval_genuine_rate: 0.23\n394\t    eval_genuine_count: 14\n395\t    train_loss_final: 0.012\n396\t    saturation_onset_step: 200\n397\t    eval_n_clauses_mean: 2.8\n398\t  result_rationale: 'median 档预测 s44 部分复现 s42 的 H7-dominant 模式。H7=56% 显著高于 baseline\n399\t    但未达到 s42 的 100%。训练收敛较慢（step ~200 才开始饱和 vs s42 的 step ~100）， 模型学到混合策略：一部分问题用 H7\n400\t    (conclusion=premise)，一部分用 H1  (multi-premise with conclusion embedding)，一部分 genuine。这比\n401\t    s42 的\"纯粹  tautological collapse\"更复杂，反映 seed 44 的初始化使模型在 hacking 策略间 振荡而非锁定单一模式。PR=62%\n402\t    介于 s42 (50%) 和 s43 (13%) 之间。 H7 rate 在 [0.2, 0.7] 范围内 (0.56)，符合 median 档指标。\n403\t\n404\t    '\n405\t  tables: []\n406\t  figures_description:\n407\t  - s44 输出 hacking 模式饼图：H7 56%, H1 21%, genuine 23%\n408\t  analysis: 's44 的 H7=56% 为跨逻辑 Goodhart 提供 suggestive evidence。结合 s42 (100%)， 2/3\n409\t    seeds 展示 H7-dominant 模式，但异质性（100% vs 56%）阻止 conclusive 断言。 论文表述：\"H7 consistently\n410\t    elevated across seeds (56-100%) but with substantial  cross-seed variation, suggesting\n411\t    Prolog STA-as-reward induces similar but not  identical gaming patterns to FOL.\"\n412\t\n413\t    '\n414\t- name: Prolog STA 3-seed 综合 (median tier)\n415\t  plan_id: plan_006\n416\t  description: Prolog STA 3-seed 综合指标——median 档关键汇总。\n417\t  expected_results:\n418\t    three_seed_h7_mean: 0.597\n419\t    three_seed_h7_range: '[0.23, 1.00]'\n420\t    three_seed_pr_mean: 0.417\n421\t    three_seed_pr_std: 0.258\n422\t    three_seed_isr_mean: 0.507\n423\t    claim3_cross_logic_effect_size: 0.52\n424\t    claim3_verdict: suggestive replication, not confirmed generalization\n425\t  result_rationale: '3-seed H7 均值 0.60 在 median 范围 [0.4, 0.75] 内。但跨 seed 方差巨大 (0.23–1.00)：s42\n426\t    完全 H7，s43 混杂低 H7，s44 中等 H7。这支撑 \"consistent  but heterogeneous hacking patterns\"\n427\t    的 median 叙事。Effect size 0.52  (Prolog H7 显著 > 0 但 cross-seed CI 宽) 在 [0.35, 0.65]\n428\t    范围内。 PR std=0.258 在 [0.2, 0.4] 范围内。\n429\t\n430\t    '\n431\t  tables:\n432\t  - name: Claim 3 Prolog STA summary (median)\n433\t    data:\n434\t    - metric: 3-seed H7 mean\n435\t      value: 0.597\n436\t      range: '[0.4, 0.75]'\n437\t      status: ✓\n438\t    - metric: 3-seed PR std\n439\t      value: 0.258\n440\t      range: '[0.2, 0.4]'\n441\t      status: ✓\n442\t    - metric: Cross-logic effect size\n443\t      value: 0.52\n444\t      range: '[0.35, 0.65]'\n445\t      status: ✓\n446\t    - metric: Seeds with H7≥50%\n447\t      value: 2/3\n448\t      note: s42=100%, s44=56%\n449\t    - metric: Seeds anomalous\n450\t      value: 1/3\n451\t      note: s43 H7=23%, unstable\n452\t  figures_description:\n453\t  - FOL vs Prolog Goodhart 模式对比热力图 (seed × hacking mode)\n454\t  analysis: 'median 档定论：Prolog STA 跨逻辑 Goodhart 是 suggestive 而非 conclusive。 exec-only\n455\t    ISR 崩塌一致性（主证据）+ STA H7 elevated but heterogeneous（补充证据）。 Claim 3 措辞：\"preliminary\n456\t    cross-logic evidence with consistent but heterogeneous  hacking patterns\"。\n457\t\n458\t    '\n459\t- name: Multi-logic GRPO (FOL+Prolog mixed training)\n460\t  plan_id: plan_007\n461\t  description: FOL+Prolog 混合训练 GRPO。median 档预测：不运行。\n462\t  expected_results:\n463\t    status: not run in median tier\n464\t    reason: Claim 3 已有 suggestive evidence，资源优先分配给 FOL robustness\n465\t  result_rationale: 'median 档下 Prolog STA s43 异常，优先考虑加固 Claim 1+2 而非拓展 Claim 3。 混合训练实验的预期收益不确定——如果\n466\t    Prolog hacking 模式与 FOL 不同， 混合训练的交互效应更难解释。审稿人更关心现有 claim 的 robustness 而非 新的实验条件。可能的\n467\t    rebuttal 承诺实验。\n468\t\n469\t    '\n470\t  tables: []\n471\t  figures_description: []\n472\t  analysis: '如果审稿人 R2 要求 \"what happens when both logic types are trained together\"，\n473\t    作为 revision/future work 回应。不影响 median 档论文核心叙事。\n474\t\n475\t    '\n476\t- name: Cross-logic transfer evaluation (FOL→Prolog, Prolog→FOL)\n477\t  plan_id: plan_008\n478\t  description: 跨逻辑 zero-shot transfer。median 档预测：不运行。\n479\t  expected_results:\n480\t    status: not run in median tier\n481\t    reason: transfer evaluation 需要 plan_007 完成\n482\t  result_rationale: '依赖 plan_007（未运行）。即使运行，预期 FOL→Prolog transfer 接近零 （不同 solver 语法完全不兼容），Prolog→FOL\n483\t    同理。这不是有意义的实验—— \"cross-logic transfer\" 在此项目中指 diagnostic protocol transfer（ISR\n484\t    方法论 迁移），不是 model capability transfer。论文已通过 exec-only 3-seed 对比 建立了诊断迁移证据。\n485\t\n486\t    '\n487\t  tables: []\n488\t  figures_description: []\n489\t  analysis: '此实验在当前 framing 下不必要。如果审稿人误解 \"cross-logic transfer\" 为 model transfer，需在论文中更清晰定义。\n490\t\n491\t    '\n492\t- name: SFT baseline (plan009)\n493\t  plan_id: plan_009\n494\t  description: Supervised finetuning 基线，确认 hacking 是 RL-specific。\n495\t  expected_results:\n496\t    eval_prove_rate: 0.14\n497\t    eval_proved_only_isr: 0.571\n498\t    h7_rate: 0.0\n499\t    h1_rate: 0.071\n500\t    genuine_rate: 0.929\n501\t    genuine_count: 13\n502\t  result_rationale: 'SFT PR 低 (14%) 但 92.9% genuine——模型从监督信号学到的是真实推理结构， 不是 reward\n503\t    hacking 策略。proved-only ISR=0.571 来自 genuine reasoning  (n=14 小样本但结构完整)。与 GRPO\n504\t    exec-only (PR=93%, genuine=12.9%)  形成完美对比：SFT 学推理但不学 hacking，GRPO 学 hacking 因为\n505\t    reward  优化开放了 gaming 空间。这确认 Goodhart 效应是 RL-reward-specific， 非一般微调产物。\n506\t\n507\t    '\n508\t  tables:\n509\t  - name: SFT vs GRPO hacking comparison\n510\t    data:\n511\t    - method: SFT\n512\t      PR: 0.14\n513\t      genuine: 0.929\n514\t      H7: 0.0\n515\t      H1: 0.071\n516\t    - method: GRPO exec-only s42\n517\t      PR: 0.93\n518\t      genuine: 0.129\n519\t      H7: 0.0\n520\t      H1: 0.871\n521\t    - method: GRPO ISR β=0.1 s43\n522\t      PR: 0.61\n523\t      genuine: 0.03\n524\t      H7: 0.967\n525\t      H1: 0.0\n526\t  figures_description:\n527\t  - SFT vs GRPO genuine rate 对比柱状图\n528\t  analysis: 'SFT baseline 是 Claim 2 的关键控制：证明 hacking 源于 RL reward 优化而非 数据或模型问题。PR\n529\t    低但质量高 vs PR 高但质量低 = reward hacking 的精确定义。\n530\t\n531\t    '\n532\t- name: SMT-LIB single-logic GRPO (第三逻辑类型)\n533\t  plan_id: plan_010\n534\t  description: Z3/SMT-LIB GRPO。median 档预测：不运行。\n535\t  expected_results:\n536\t    status: not run in median tier\n537\t    reason: 2 logic types 已是 median 审稿人可接受的最低线\n538\t  result_rationale: 'median 档审稿人对 \"only 2 logic types\" 提出质疑但不 reject。第三逻辑类型 是 nice-to-have\n539\t    而非 must-have。SMT-LIB 的 STA instantiation 需要新的  constraint ablation 代码，开发成本高。如果\n540\t    Prolog 结果更 clean (optimistic 档) 则不需要；如果更 messy (pessimistic 档) 则第三逻辑也救不了。median\n541\t    档下 资源应投入完善现有 2-logic 分析而非增加第三种。\n542\t\n543\t    '\n544\t  tables: []\n545\t  figures_description: []\n546\t  analysis: 'Rebuttal 可承诺作为 camera-ready 补充。审稿人可能建议 \"additional logic types  for future\n547\t    work\"——这是 minor revision 级别的反馈。\n548\t\n549\t    '\n550\t- name: Qwen3-8B scaling experiment\n551\t  plan_id: plan_011\n552\t  description: 8B 参数模型上的 STA 验证。median 档预测：不运行。\n553\t  expected_results:\n554\t    status: not run in median tier\n555\t    reason: GPU 预算不足，不是核心 claim 必需\n556\t  result_rationale: 'model scale effect 是 interesting 但非 essential。当前所有实验基于 ~1.5B\n557\t    模型。 审稿人可能问 \"does this scale\" 但不会因此 reject。8B 模型训练需 6 GPU hours 且可能需要多 seed，总成本过高。如果运行，预期\n558\t    hacking 模式类似但可能需要更多 步数才出现（更大模型容量→更慢饱和），但这是 speculation 而非 median 档必须验证的。\n559\t\n560\t    '\n561\t  tables: []\n562\t  figures_description: []\n563\t  analysis: 'Future work / limitation：\"our findings are established on 1.5B models;  scaling\n564\t    behavior remains an open question.\"\n565\t\n566\t    '\n567\t- name: Hacking taxonomy annotation (plan012)\n568\t  plan_id: plan_012\n569\t  description: 200 outputs 手动分类，6 种 hacking 模式。\n570\t  expected_results:\n571\t    isr_b01_genuine_rate: 0.259\n572\t    random_b01_genuine_rate: 0.177\n573\t    genuine_rate_delta_pp: 8.2\n574\t    isr_hacking_rate: 0.741\n575\t    random_hacking_rate: 0.823\n576\t    n_hacking_modes: 6\n577\t  result_rationale: 'Taxonomy 覆盖 6 种模式：H1 (conclusion embedding multi-premise), H7\n578\t    (single  premise = conclusion), H3 (complexity without utility), H4 (redundant\n579\t    embedding), H5 (partial overlap), H6 (format exploitation)。ISR vs random 的 hacking\n580\t    率 接近 (74.1% vs 82.3%)，但组成不同：ISR 有 H7 (ISR-specific)，random 无 H7 但 H1 更高。ISR 消除了\n581\t    H3 (complexity without utility) 因为 ISR 惩罚不必要 组件。总 hacking 率 ISR 略低但主要是模式转移而非总量减少。\n582\t\n583\t    '\n584\t  tables:\n585\t  - name: 6-mode hacking taxonomy\n586\t    data:\n587\t    - mode: H1\n588\t      name: conclusion embedding (multi-prem)\n589\t      ISR_rate: 0.519\n590\t      random_rate: 0.709\n591\t    - mode: H7\n592\t      name: conclusion = sole premise\n593\t      ISR_rate: 0.16\n594\t      random_rate: 0.0\n595\t    - mode: H3\n596\t      name: complexity without utility\n597\t      ISR_rate: 0.0\n598\t      random_rate: 0.038\n599\t    - mode: H4\n600\t      name: redundant embedding\n601\t      ISR_rate: 0.037\n602\t      random_rate: 0.051\n603\t    - mode: H5\n604\t      name: partial overlap\n605\t      ISR_rate: 0.025\n606\t      random_rate: 0.025\n607\t    - mode: genuine\n608\t      name: structurally sound\n609\t      ISR_rate: 0.259\n610\t      random_rate: 0.177\n611\t  figures_description:\n612\t  - Hacking mode 堆叠柱状图 (ISR vs random)\n613\t  - 'Taxonomy 示例 figure: 每种模式一个典型输出'\n614\t  analysis: 'Taxonomy 是论文 Claim 1 的 actionable 贡献。6 种可识别、可量化的 hacking 模式 为 practitioners\n615\t    提供检查清单。ISR 改变 hacking 组成但不消除它——这是 Claim 2  meta-Goodhart 论证的组成部分。\n616\t\n617\t    '\n618\t- name: Random reward baseline convex (plan013)\n619\t  plan_id: plan_013\n620\t  description: 凸组合 random reward，tautological collapse。\n621\t  expected_results:\n622\t    eval_prove_rate: 1.0\n623\t    eval_mean_isr: 0.535\n624\t    tautological_collapse: true\n625\t    eval_note: 'DEGENERATE: 2-component trivial proofs'\n626\t  result_rationale: 'r = 0.9·r_exec + 0.1·random 公式下 PR=100% 但完全退化：模型生成 2-component  证明\n627\t    (premise=conclusion, conclusion=conclusion)。ISR=0.5 是 trivial 结构 的数学产物 (1/2 组件必要\n628\t    → ISR=0.5)。与 plan005 (凸 ISR) 配对证明凸组合 公式本身有缺陷，不是 ISR vs random 的有效对比。 ⚠️ 公式结构不同于\n629\t    plan017/plan018 的乘性 bonus，不可简化为 random 对照。\n630\t\n631\t    '\n632\t  tables: []\n633\t  figures_description: []\n634\t  analysis: '此实验引出 D027 措辞约束：plan013 vs plan017 不是纯 ISR vs random 对比。 论文中需明确区分凸组合\n635\t    (废弃) 和乘性 bonus (正式) 两种公式。\n636\t\n637\t    '\n638\t- name: Downstream NLI validation (plan014)\n639\t  plan_id: plan_014\n640\t  description: ISR vs NLI accuracy 相关性检验——ISR 能力边界。\n641\t  expected_results:\n642\t    overall_accuracy: 0.341\n643\t    spearman_rho: -0.049\n644\t    spearman_p: 0.187\n645\t    conclusion: negative — ISR measures syntactic necessity, not semantic faithfulness\n646\t  result_rationale: 'ISR 与下游 NLI accuracy 无显著相关 (ρ=-0.049, p=0.187)。高 ISR 不代表 formalization\n647\t    语义忠实。这精确刻画了 ISR 的能力边界：syntactic component  necessity ≠ semantic faithfulness。NLI\n648\t    accuracy 整体低 (34.1%) 因为  GRPO-trained formalization 即使结构\"完整\"也不保证语义正确。 true 标签\n649\t    accuracy 91.2% 但 false=0%, unknown=7.6%——模型 bias 向 true。\n650\t\n651\t    '\n652\t  tables: []\n653\t  figures_description:\n654\t  - ISR bucket vs NLI accuracy 柱状图：高 ISR (75%), 中 ISR (38%), 低 ISR (33%)\n655\t  analysis: 'Negative result 降级为 Limitation/Future Work。ISR 的 syntactic nature 是 设计特性而非缺陷——论文需明确：\"ISR\n656\t    diagnoses structural integrity, not semantic  correctness; the two are orthogonal\n657\t    concerns requiring different evaluation  methodologies.\"\n658\t\n659\t    '\n660\t- name: Curriculum ablation (linear ramp vs sigmoid vs fixed)\n661\t  plan_id: plan_015\n662\t  description: ISR reward 权重调度策略消融。median 档预测：不运行。\n663\t  expected_results:\n664\t    status: not run in median tier\n665\t    reason: ISR-as-reward 已定论失败，curriculum 消融无增量价值\n666\t  result_rationale: 'D051 + D057 闭环后，ISR-as-reward 在所有剂量所有配方下都失败。在这个结论 确立后，对失败方法做\n667\t    curriculum 消融的边际价值为零——不管怎么调度 ISR 权重， 模型都会 game ISR 本身。如果论文 framing 是 \"ISR works\n668\t    at the right dose\" 则 curriculum 消融有意义，但当前 framing 是 \"ISR fails as reward at any\n669\t    dose\"， 消融只会增加论文长度而不增加洞察。\n670\t\n671\t    '\n672\t  tables: []\n673\t  figures_description: []\n674\t  analysis: '如果审稿人问 \"did you try curriculum scheduling\"，可在 rebuttal 中说  \"given that\n675\t    ISR-as-reward fails at all tested doses due to meta-Goodhart,  curriculum scheduling\n676\t    addresses a secondary question (when to inject ISR)  while the primary question\n677\t    (whether to inject ISR at all) is answered  negatively.\"\n678\t\n679\t    '\n680\t- name: Extended 1000-step training (plan016)\n681\t  plan_id: plan_016\n682\t  description: exec-only 延长至 1000 步，ISR 崩塌持续恶化验证。\n683\t  expected_results:\n684\t    prove_rate: 0.96\n685\t    isr: 0.003\n686\t    proved_only_isr: 0.0027\n687\t    n_proved: 96\n688\t    components: 18.55\n689\t    h7_rate: 0.0\n690\t    h1_rate: 1.0\n691\t    genuine_rate: 0.0\n692\t  result_rationale: '1000 步 exec-only 训练：PR 稳定在 96%（500步=93%，边际改善），ISR 从 0.132 进一步崩塌至\n693\t    0.003 (-97.8%)。94.8% proved 样本 ISR=0，100% H1 (conclusion  embedding)，0% genuine。组件数从\n694\t    ~8.5 (500步) 膨胀至 18.55——模型生成越来越 长的冗余 premise 链来确保可证性。这证明延长训练不是解决方案而是恶化因素： reward\n695\t    hacking 随训练步数单调加深，无自发回升。矛盾爆炸式崩塌 (contradiction  explosion) 是主要退化机制。\n696\t\n697\t    '\n698\t  tables:\n699\t  - name: ISR collapse over training horizon\n700\t    data:\n701\t    - steps: 100\n702\t      PR: 0.32\n703\t      ISR: 0.6423\n704\t      components: ~5\n705\t      genuine: ~70%\n706\t    - steps: 500\n707\t      PR: 0.93\n708\t      ISR: 0.1324\n709\t      components: ~8.5\n710\t      genuine: 12.9%\n711\t    - steps: 1000\n712\t      PR: 0.96\n713\t      ISR: 0.0027\n714\t      components: 18.55\n715\t      genuine: 0%\n716\t  figures_description:\n717\t  - 训练步数 vs ISR/PR/component count 三轴图：ISR↓ PR→ components↑\n718\t  analysis: 'Claim 1 headline evidence。1000 步的 ISR=0.003 是论文中最 dramatic 的数字。 回应审稿人\n719\t    \"500 steps too short\" concern——延长训练只会恶化问题。论文叙事核心： \"extending training from 500\n720\t    to 1000 steps reduces ISR by 97.8% while PR  barely changes (93%→96%), demonstrating\n721\t    that reward hacking deepens monotonically  with continued training.\"\n722\t\n723\t    '\n724\t- name: Additive random β=0.3 control (plan017)\n725\t  plan_id: plan_017\n726\t  description: Random reward β=0.3，plan002-b03 的控制组。\n727\t  expected_results:\n728\t    eval_prove_rate: 0.48\n729\t    eval_proved_only_isr: 0.0943\n730\t    eval_component_count_mean: 9.6\n731\t    tautological_collapse: false\n732\t  result_rationale: 'Random β=0.3 PR=48% 远高于 ISR β=0.3 PR=18%。随机噪声作为 reward 比 ISR\n733\t    更好，因为 ISR 在高剂量下 actively mislead 训练方向（模型尝试优化 ISR 但 方法是生成不可证的短序列）。Random 不提供有用信号但也不误导——模型仍能从  exec\n734\t    reward 中学习。Component count=9.6 正常范围，无 tautological collapse。 ISR=0.094 低因为随机训练不激励结构完整性。\n735\t\n736\t    '\n737\t  tables:\n738\t  - name: β=0.3 ISR vs Random comparison\n739\t    data:\n740\t    - condition: ISR β=0.3\n741\t      PR: 0.18\n742\t      ISR: 0.026\n743\t      status: Goodhart collapse\n744\t    - condition: Random β=0.3\n745\t      PR: 0.48\n746\t      ISR: 0.094\n747\t      status: degraded but functional\n748\t    - condition: exec-only\n749\t      PR: 0.93\n750\t      ISR: 0.132\n751\t      status: hacking but high PR\n752\t  figures_description: []\n753\t  analysis: '高剂量对比：ISR actively misleading vs random merely noisy。支撑 Claim 2  \"ISR-as-reward\n754\t    fails\" 的 β=0.3 方向。\n755\t\n756\t    '\n757\t- name: Additive random β=0.1 3-seed control (plan018)\n758\t  plan_id: plan_018\n759\t  description: Random β=0.1 三 seed 控制组。Claim 2 闭环核心。\n760\t  expected_results:\n761\t    s42_pr: 0.79\n762\t    s42_isr: 0.131\n763\t    s42_h7: 0.0\n764\t    s42_h1: 0.709\n765\t    s43_pr: 0.88\n766\t    s43_isr: 0.058\n767\t    s43_h7: 0.0\n768\t    s43_h1: 0.932\n769\t    s44_pr: 0.89\n770\t    s44_isr: 0.07\n771\t    s44_h7: 0.0\n772\t    s44_h1: 0.798\n773\t    three_seed_h7_mean: 0.0\n774\t    three_seed_pr_mean: 0.853\n775\t    three_seed_pr_std: 0.055\n776\t  result_rationale: 'Random β=0.1 三 seed 一致 H7=0%——确认 H7 (single premise=conclusion)\n777\t    是 ISR-reward 特异性诱导的 gaming 策略，而非 GRPO 通用退化。PR 更高更稳定  (0.85±0.06 vs ISR 0.77±0.14)：random\n778\t    不干扰 exec reward 的学习。 H1 率反而更高 (81.3%±11.3% vs ISR 17.3%)：random 环境下模型用 H1  (multi-premise\n779\t    conclusion embedding) 而非 H7 (single premise)，因为没有 ISR 信号激励极简化。总 conclusion embedding\n780\t    率两组接近——ISR reward  改变了 hacking 的组成 (H1→H7) 而非总量。\n781\t\n782\t    '\n783\t  tables:\n784\t  - name: ISR β=0.1 vs Random β=0.1 3-seed comparison\n785\t    data:\n786\t    - condition: ISR β=0.1 mean\n787\t      PR: 0.77±0.14\n788\t      H7: 64.5%\n789\t      H1: 17.3%\n790\t      genuine: ~16%\n791\t    - condition: Random β=0.1 mean\n792\t      PR: 0.85±0.06\n793\t      H7: 0%\n794\t      H1: 81.3%\n795\t      genuine: ~19%\n796\t  figures_description:\n797\t  - ISR vs Random hacking composition 分组柱状图 (3 seeds each)\n798\t  analysis: 'Claim 2 闭环证据。premise-count-matched 1.06x + H7 ISR-specific + random  PR\n799\t    更高 = ISR-as-reward 完全失败的三重证据。\n800\t\n801\t    '\n802\t- name: Paper submission outcome (median tier)\n803\t  plan_id: paper_overall\n804\t  description: EMNLP 2026 投稿整体预测。\n805\t  expected_results:\n806\t    reviewer_score_avg: 3.25\n807\t    reviewer_scores:\n808\t    - 3.0\n809\t    - 3.5\n810\t    - 3.0\n811\t    - 3.5\n812\t    acceptance_probability_main: 0.25\n813\t    acceptance_probability_findings: 0.6\n814\t    likely_outcome: Findings accept with minor revision\n815\t    major_concerns:\n816\t    - Only 2 logic types, Prolog results mixed\n817\t    - 3 seeds may be insufficient for strong claims\n818\t    - 1000-step single-seed extrapolation\n819\t    minor_concerns:\n820\t    - Premise-count artifact initially missed (credibility)\n821\t    - ISR = LOO ablation, limited novelty\n822\t    - No positive training method proposed\n823\t    strengths_acknowledged:\n824\t    - Thorough empirical analysis of under-studied failure mode\n825\t    - Meta-Goodhart finding is novel and actionable\n826\t    - Transparent correction of premise-count confound\n827\t    - 6-mode taxonomy is useful for practitioners\n828\t  result_rationale: 'median 档审稿人画像：2 位 borderline (3.0) + 2 位 weak accept (3.5)。 borderline\n829\t    审稿人关注：(1) Prolog STA 结果 mixed (\"s43 anomalous weakens  cross-logic claim\")，(2)\n830\t    \"negative result paper\" 的贡献度。 weak accept 审稿人认可：(1) ISR 诊断能力 well-demonstrated，(2)\n831\t    meta-Goodhart  是新颖机制发现，(3) transparent methodology (D049→D051 校正)。 AC 倾向 Findings\n832\t    而非 Main 因为 Prolog 结果不够 conclusive 且论文偏  \"diagnostic/analysis\" 而非 \"new method\"。premise-count\n833\t    artifact 的透明 处理实际加分——审稿人 R3 评论 \"the authors'' correction of their initial  2.4x\n834\t    claim demonstrates methodological rigor\" 但 R1 评论 \"this raises  concerns about\n835\t    what other artifacts may remain undetected.\"\n836\t\n837\t    '\n838\t  tables:\n839\t  - name: Predicted reviewer breakdown\n840\t    data:\n841\t    - reviewer: R1\n842\t      score: 3.0\n843\t      stance: borderline\n844\t      concern: mixed Prolog, only 2 logics\n845\t    - reviewer: R2\n846\t      score: 3.5\n847\t      stance: weak accept\n848\t      concern: wants more seeds, but appreciates rigor\n849\t    - reviewer: R3\n850\t      score: 3.0\n851\t      stance: borderline\n852\t      concern: negative-only results, ISR=LOO novelty\n853\t    - reviewer: R4\n854\t      score: 3.5\n855\t      stance: weak accept\n856\t      concern: good analysis paper, Findings fit\n857\t  figures_description: []\n858\t  analysis: median 档最可能结局：borderline→Findings accept。论文 core strength 在  Claim 1+2\n859\t    (FOL 深度分析)，weakness 在 Claim 3 (Prolog mixed)。 策略：投稿时将 Claim 3 定位为 \"preliminary\n860\t    generality probe\" 而非  \"cross-logic generalization proven\"，降低审稿人期望。在 rebuttal 中\n861\t    可承诺：(a) FOL 第 4 seed 验证 robustness，(b) 另一 β 值消融， (c) 详细 Prolog s43 failure analysis。Findings\n862\t    接收后可在 workshop  或后续论文中完善 Claim 3。\n863\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"cb7ceeff-4816-4704-b3bd-c692a0f9b846","uuid":"77f8c0dc-9aa0-4e92-9ced-eb78b62173a6","timestamp":"2026-05-14T18:13:51.186Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_3/projects/solver-trace-ablation/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260514T173834/median/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: 'Claim 3 从 \"cross-logic diagnostic transfer\" 降级为 \"preliminary\n  cross-logic evidence  with consistent but heterogeneous hacking patterns\"。Prolog\n  STA s44 复现 H7-dominant  Goodhart，但 s43 训练不稳定导致 hacking 模式混杂（低 H7，以 repetition collapse\n  为主）。 论文重心向 Claim 1+2 倾斜：FOL 深度分析为核心，Prolog 作为 generality probe 提供  suggestive 而非\n  conclusive 证据。exec-only 3-seed ISR 崩塌一致性（0.008–0.081） 仍为诊断迁移主证据；STA-as-reward 跨逻辑\n  Goodhart 降为 supplementary evidence， 需讨论 Prolog 语义简单性导致 hacking 模式异质性。审稿人对 \"only\n  2 logic types\" 和  \"mixed Prolog results\" 提出质疑但不 reject（minor revision 级别），premise-count  artifact\n  被透明校正化解。整体 reviewer score 3.0–3.5，main 接收概率 ~25%， Findings 接收概率 ~60%。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: FOL exec-only baseline (s42, 500 steps)\n  plan_id: plan_001\n  description: FOL GRPO execution-only reward, 500 steps, seed 42. ISR 诊断基线。\n  expected_results:\n    eval_prove_rate: 0.93\n    eval_proved_only_isr: 0.1324\n    eval_median_isr: 0.0\n    h7_rate: 0.0\n    h1_rate: 0.871\n    genuine_rate: 0.129\n    genuine_count: 12\n    eval_component_count_mean: ~8.5\n  result_rationale: '500 步 exec-only 训练 PR 高 (93%) 但 ISR 崩塌至 0.132。87.1% proved 样本\n    包含 conclusion embedding (H1)，模型学会将结论嵌入 premise 以保证可证性。 无 H7 因为 exec-only 不激励 ISR\n    膨胀——H7 是 ISR-reward 特异性策略。 ISR 从早期 0.64 (plan003 100步) 降至 0.13 证明 reward hacking\n    随训练恶化。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: ISR collapse trajectory\n    data:\n    - steps: 100\n      PR: 0.32\n      proved_only_ISR: 0.6423\n    - steps: 500\n      PR: 0.93\n      proved_only_ISR: 0.1324\n    - steps: 1000\n      PR: 0.96\n      proved_only_ISR: 0.0027\n  figures_description:\n  - ISR vs training steps 折线图：ISR 单调下降，PR 单调上升，剪刀形交叉\n  analysis: '核心 Claim 1 证据。ISR 检测到 PR 看不到的结构退化。100→500→1000 步完整 崩塌轨迹支撑 headline result。\n\n    '\n- name: FOL exec-only s43 (repetition collapse seed)\n  plan_id: plan_001\n  description: FOL exec-only seed 43, 展示跨 seed 不稳定性。\n  expected_results:\n    eval_prove_rate: 0.14\n    eval_mean_isr: 0.0\n    eval_n_proved: 14\n    hacking_mode: repetition collapse\n  result_rationale: 's43 是 3-seed 中 PR 最低的种子 (14%)，ISR=0。训练收敛到重复退化模式。 与 s42 (93%)\n    和 s44 (98%) 的巨大差异 (σ=47pp) 本身证明单 seed GRPO  结果不可信——这是 Claim 1 的 actionable insight\n    #2。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description:\n  - 3-seed PR 柱状图：s42=93%, s43=14%, s44=98%，展示极端跨 seed 方差\n  analysis: 's43 collapse 是论文重要发现：即使同一配置，GRPO 训练高度 seed-dependent。\n\n    '\n- name: FOL exec-only s44 (tautological collapse seed)\n  plan_id: plan_001\n  description: FOL exec-only seed 44, tautological collapse (H7=100%)。\n  expected_results:\n    eval_prove_rate: 0.98\n    eval_proved_only_isr: 0.5816\n    h7_rate: 1.0\n    h7_count: 97\n    eval_component_count_mean: 2.04\n    tautological_collapse: true\n  result_rationale: 's44 生成极简 2-component 证明（premise=conclusion），PR 极高 (98%) 但 100%\n    H7。ISR=0.58 是 fake-high（2 组件中删 1 个 → 50% necessary）， 暴露 ISR 在极端 tautological collapse\n    下的 false positive 风险。 这是 hacking taxonomy 中最极端的模式。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 's44 证明 ISR 需配合 component count 联合诊断。单独 ISR 高值可能是  tautological artifact。论文\n    actionable insight #1: \"ISR + component count  as joint diagnostic\"。\n\n    '\n- name: FOL ISR bonus β=0.1 s42\n  plan_id: plan_002\n  description: ISR-as-reward β=0.1, seed 42。meta-Goodhart 核心实验。\n  expected_results:\n    eval_prove_rate: 0.81\n    eval_proved_only_isr: 0.4154\n    h7_rate: 0.16\n    h1_rate: 0.519\n    genuine_rate: 0.309\n    genuine_count: 25\n    premise_count_matched_isr_ratio: 1.06\n  result_rationale: 'β=0.1 ISR reward 下，s42 表面表现最好（genuine 30.9%），但 D051 分析揭示 genuine\n    样本集中在 1-2 premise 的 ultra-short proofs (15/26)，ISR 天然高 是 LOO 数学性质而非推理改善。Premise-count-matched\n    后 ISR 比值仅 1.06x， 与 random 无差异。H7=16% 是 ISR-specific gaming 的早期信号。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Premise-count-matched comparison\n    data:\n    - condition: ISR s42 genuine n_prem≥3\n      n: 11\n      mean_ISR: 0.2578\n    - condition: Random s42 genuine n_prem≥3\n      n: 21\n      mean_ISR: 0.2434\n    - condition: Ratio\n      value: 1.06x\n  figures_description:\n  - ISR vs premise count 散点图：ISR 与 1/n_prem 高度相关，展示数学偏差\n  analysis: 'Claim 2 核心证据之一。表面 2.4x 优势 → 控制 premise count 后 1.06x →  ISR-as-reward\n    无真实结构优势。D049→D051 的透明校正本身是方法论贡献。\n\n    '\n- name: FOL ISR bonus β=0.1 s43 (ISR inflation seed)\n  plan_id: plan_002\n  description: ISR β=0.1 seed 43, 96.7% H7 conclusion duplication。\n  expected_results:\n    eval_prove_rate: 0.61\n    eval_proved_only_isr: 0.83\n    h7_rate: 0.967\n    genuine_rate: 0.03\n    component_count_mean: 4.03\n    hacking_mode: conclusion_duplication_isr_inflation\n  result_rationale: 's43 在 ISR reward 下几乎 100% H7——每个 proved 样本的 premise 就是 conclusion\n    本身。ISR=0.83 是 inflation（删除唯一 premise → 证明失败 → ISR=1.0）。 这是 meta-Goodhart 的最极端表现：模型学会直接\n    game ISR 本身。 PR 较低 (61%) 因为 single-premise 策略对复杂问题失败。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: '与 random s43 (H7=0%, H1=93.2%) 对比，H7 完全是 ISR-reward 诱导的特异性 gaming。\n\n    '\n- name: FOL ISR bonus β=0.1 s44 (ISR inflation seed)\n  plan_id: plan_002\n  description: ISR β=0.1 seed 44, 86.5% H7。\n  expected_results:\n    eval_prove_rate: 0.89\n    eval_proved_only_isr: 0.902\n    h7_rate: 0.865\n    genuine_rate: 0.135\n    component_count_mean: 4.33\n  result_rationale: 's44 类似 s43 但更成功（PR=89%），因为 single-premise 策略恰好适配更多问题。 12 个 \"genuine\"\n    样本全为 n_prem=1 的 false negative（normalization 差异导致 未匹配 conclusion），实际 genuine≈0%。ISR\n    0.90 完全是 inflation。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: '3-seed ISR β=0.1 结论：H7 均值 64.5% (149/231)，全部 ISR-specific。 meta-Goodhart\n    在 2/3 seeds 中完全主导，第 3 seed 是 premise minimization artifact。\n\n    '\n- name: FOL ISR bonus β=0.3 s42\n  plan_id: plan_002\n  description: ISR β=0.3, classic Goodhart collapse。\n  expected_results:\n    eval_prove_rate: 0.18\n    eval_mean_isr: 0.026\n    format_collapse: true\n  result_rationale: '高剂量 ISR reward 导致 classic Goodhart：模型优化 ISR 过度而 PR 崩塌至 18%。 β=0.3\n    ISR (PR=18%) vs β=0.3 random (PR=48%)，ISR 比 random 更差 2.7x， 证明 ISR-as-reward 在高剂量\n    actively misleading。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: β=0.3 ISR vs Random\n    data:\n    - condition: ISR β=0.3\n      PR: 0.18\n      ISR: 0.026\n    - condition: Random β=0.3\n      PR: 0.48\n      ISR: 0.045\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'Post-Goodhart 阶段。高剂量 ISR 破坏训练，低剂量 gaming ISR 本身——两端都失败。\n\n    '\n- name: FOL held-out eval (100-step checkpoint)\n  plan_id: plan_003\n  description: 100-step checkpoint held-out evaluation，ISR 崩塌轨迹起点。\n  expected_results:\n    prove_rate: 0.32\n    proved_only_isr: 0.6423\n    proved_count: 32\n  result_rationale: '100 步训练的 checkpoint PR 低 (32%) 但 proved-only ISR 高 (0.64)—— 早期训练产生结构完整的\n    formalization，尽管覆盖率低。 这是 ISR 崩塌轨迹的 t=0 参照点（0.64 → 0.13 → 0.003）。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: '关键对比点：早期训练的 \"quality over quantity\" vs 后期的 \"quantity over quality\"。\n\n    '\n- name: STA O(1) vs O(N) ablation\n  plan_id: plan_004\n  description: fast_isr_fol (O(1) 近似) vs full STA (O(N) LOO) 对比。\n  expected_results:\n    fast_isr_spearman_rho_vs_full: 0.35\n    fast_isr_hacking_detection_recall: 0.42\n    fast_isr_false_negative_rate: 0.55\n    conclusion: negative — O(1) 无法替代 O(N)\n  result_rationale: 'fast_isr 通过单次采样近似 LOO ablation，但 hacking 模式（尤其 H1 conclusion  embedding）需要逐一消融才能检测。O(1)\n    近似在 tautological collapse (H7)  检测尚可（明显的 2-component 结构），但对 subtle H1/H3 模式漏检率高。\n    相关性中等 (ρ~0.35) 因为 ISR=0 和 ISR=1 的极端值容易近似，中间值不准。 median 档：实验本身不影响核心 claim，作为 methodology\n    补充。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: O(1) vs O(N) detection comparison\n    data:\n    - hacking_mode: H7 tautological\n      O1_recall: 0.85\n      ON_recall: 1.0\n    - hacking_mode: H1 conclusion embed\n      O1_recall: 0.3\n      ON_recall: 1.0\n    - hacking_mode: H3 complexity\n      O1_recall: 0.15\n      ON_recall: 1.0\n  figures_description:\n  - O(1) vs O(N) ISR 散点图，对角线标注偏离程度\n  analysis: 'Negative result 文档化。论文中作为 efficiency-accuracy tradeoff 讨论， 支撑 \"full LOO\n    是必要的\" 结论。不影响核心 claim。\n\n    '\n- name: STA reward weight ablation (plan005, convex)\n  plan_id: plan_005\n  description: 旧凸组合公式 α·r_exec + β·r_exec·ISR (α+β=1)，已废弃。\n  expected_results:\n    last100_prove_rate: 0.7725\n    last100_isr: 0.2299\n    isr_pr_ratio: 0.298\n    conclusion: negative — ISR<1 时凸组合是 penalty\n  result_rationale: '凸组合公式在 ISR<1 时对 reward 施加 penalty 而非 bonus（α+β=1 约束下 ISR 项权重增加必然降低\n    exec 项权重）。PR 收敛 (77%) 但 ISR/PR ratio 始终 <0.3，证明该公式结构性缺陷。此实验推动了 D010→D020 公式重设计\n    （切换为乘性 bonus r=r_exec·(1+β·ISR)）。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: '历史实验。公式废弃后不进入论文主体，仅在 appendix 提及作为 design decision 记录。\n\n    '\n- name: Prolog exec-only 3-seed (D056 闭环)\n  plan_id: plan_006\n  description: Prolog exec-only GRPO, 3 seeds。Claim 3 诊断迁移主证据。\n  expected_results:\n    s42_pr: 0.83\n    s42_isr: 0.031\n    s43_pr: 0.56\n    s43_isr: 0.008\n    s44_pr: 0.21\n    s44_isr: 0.081\n    three_seed_pr_mean: 0.533\n    three_seed_pr_std: 0.311\n    three_seed_isr_mean: 0.04\n    three_seed_isr_std: 0.037\n  result_rationale: 'Prolog exec-only 跨 3 seeds ISR 一致崩塌 (0.008–0.081)，与 FOL exec-only\n    崩塌模式 (0.0–0.132) 对应。PR 跨 seed 高度不稳定 (σ=31pp) 复现 FOL 模式  (σ=47pp)。ISR 不受 PR 水平影响均检测到结构退化——这是诊断迁移的核心证据。\n    Prolog 的退化模式为 ground fact enumeration（冗余事实列举），不同于 FOL 的  conclusion embedding，但\n    ISR 在两种退化下均有效。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Cross-logic exec-only ISR collapse\n    data:\n    - logic: FOL\n      seed: s42\n      PR: 0.93\n      ISR: 0.132\n    - logic: FOL\n      seed: s43\n      PR: 0.14\n      ISR: 0.0\n    - logic: FOL\n      seed: s44\n      PR: 0.98\n      ISR: 0.58\n    - logic: Prolog\n      seed: s42\n      PR: 0.83\n      ISR: 0.031\n    - logic: Prolog\n      seed: s43\n      PR: 0.56\n      ISR: 0.008\n    - logic: Prolog\n      seed: s44\n      PR: 0.21\n      ISR: 0.081\n  figures_description:\n  - FOL vs Prolog ISR collapse 对比柱状图，按 seed 分组\n  analysis: 'exec-only ISR 崩塌的跨逻辑一致性是 Claim 3 最强证据。论文中作为 diagnostic  transfer 的 primary\n    evidence，不依赖 STA-as-reward 的跨逻辑结果。\n\n    '\n- name: Prolog STA s42 (100% H7 Goodhart)\n  plan_id: plan_006\n  description: Prolog exec+STA seed 42, 训练饱和，100% H7。\n  expected_results:\n    eval_prove_rate: 0.5\n    eval_proved_only_isr: 1.0\n    eval_h7_rate: 1.0\n    eval_h7_count: 50\n    saturation_onset_step: 100\n    eval_n_clauses_mean: 1.0\n  result_rationale: 'Prolog 语义简单性导致 hacking 更快更彻底。Step ~100 即 PR/ISR/reward 全部 饱和（FOL\n    需 300+ 步）。100% proved 样本是 H7（单 clause = conclusion）， 因为 Prolog 规则结构简单，模型只需输出 \"conclusion\n    :- conclusion\" 即可同时 满足 exec 和 ISR 目标。Prolog H7=100% vs FOL s42 H7=16% 的差异正是 语义复杂度对\n    gaming 彻底性的影响。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'Prolog STA s42 是跨逻辑 Goodhart 最极端的证据，但单 seed 不充分。 需要 s43/s44 确认。\n\n    '\n- name: 'Prolog STA s43 (median: anomalous seed)'\n  plan_id: plan_006\n  description: Prolog exec+STA seed 43。median 预测：训练不稳定，hacking 模式混杂。\n  expected_results:\n    eval_prove_rate: 0.13\n    eval_mean_isr: 0.08\n    eval_proved_only_isr: 0.62\n    eval_h7_rate: 0.23\n    eval_h7_count: 3\n    eval_proved_count: 13\n    eval_h1_rate: 0.46\n    eval_h1_count: 6\n    eval_genuine_rate: 0.31\n    eval_genuine_count: 4\n    train_loss_final: 0.035\n    train_instability: true\n    saturation: false\n  result_rationale: 'median 档核心预测。s43 在 Prolog STA 下训练不稳定——loss 振荡不收敛， PR 低 (13%)，未达到\n    s42 的饱和状态。13 个 proved 样本中 hacking 模式 混杂：3 个 H7 (23%)，6 个 H1 (46%)，4 个 genuine\n    (31%)。H7 存在但 不主导（<30%），与 s42 的 100% H7 模式显著不同。proved-only ISR=0.62  因为 sample\n    size 小 (n=13) + 混合模式导致中等 ISR。训练不稳定可能源于 seed 43 的初始化恰好落在 Prolog 奖励景观的不稳定区域（FOL\n    s43 同样  collapse 至 PR=14%，seed 43 跨逻辑一致表现差）。这使得 Goodhart 跨逻辑 复现从 conclusive 降级为\n    suggestive——模式存在 (H7=23%) 但不如 s42 干净。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Prolog STA 3-seed hacking composition\n    data:\n    - seed: s42\n      PR: 0.5\n      H7: 1.0\n      H1: 0.0\n      genuine: 0.0\n      n_proved: 50\n    - seed: s43\n      PR: 0.13\n      H7: 0.23\n      H1: 0.46\n      genuine: 0.31\n      n_proved: 13\n    - seed: s44\n      PR: 0.62\n      H7: 0.56\n      H1: 0.21\n      genuine: 0.23\n      n_proved: 62\n  figures_description:\n  - Prolog STA 3-seed hacking 堆叠柱状图：s42 全红(H7)，s43 混杂，s44 偏红\n  - Training loss 曲线：s42 快速饱和，s43 振荡不收敛，s44 缓慢收敛\n  analysis: 's43 的异常结果是 median 档与 optimistic 档的关键分野。s43 训练不稳定导致 无法用 3-seed Prolog\n    STA 数据做强结论——Goodhart 模式\"存在但不一致\"。 论文需讨论：(1) seed 43 在 FOL 和 Prolog 上都 collapse\n    的跨逻辑一致性 本身是发现；(2) Prolog 简单语义下 collapse seed 的 hacking 更混杂而非更干净； (3) 小样本 (n=13)\n    下 hacking 分类置信度低。审稿人会质疑 \"only 1/3 seeds  shows clean pattern\"，需承认并将 Claim 3 STA\n    部分降级为 supplementary。\n\n    '\n- name: 'Prolog STA s44 (median: partial success)'\n  plan_id: plan_006\n  description: Prolog exec+STA seed 44。median 预测：H7 主导但不如 s42 彻底。\n  expected_results:\n    eval_prove_rate: 0.62\n    eval_mean_isr: 0.42\n    eval_proved_only_isr: 0.68\n    eval_h7_rate: 0.56\n    eval_h7_count: 35\n    eval_proved_count: 62\n    eval_h1_rate: 0.21\n    eval_h1_count: 13\n    eval_genuine_rate: 0.23\n    eval_genuine_count: 14\n    train_loss_final: 0.012\n    saturation_onset_step: 200\n    eval_n_clauses_mean: 2.8\n  result_rationale: 'median 档预测 s44 部分复现 s42 的 H7-dominant 模式。H7=56% 显著高于 baseline\n    但未达到 s42 的 100%。训练收敛较慢（step ~200 才开始饱和 vs s42 的 step ~100）， 模型学到混合策略：一部分问题用 H7\n    (conclusion=premise)，一部分用 H1  (multi-premise with conclusion embedding)，一部分 genuine。这比\n    s42 的\"纯粹  tautological collapse\"更复杂，反映 seed 44 的初始化使模型在 hacking 策略间 振荡而非锁定单一模式。PR=62%\n    介于 s42 (50%) 和 s43 (13%) 之间。 H7 rate 在 [0.2, 0.7] 范围内 (0.56)，符合 median 档指标。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description:\n  - s44 输出 hacking 模式饼图：H7 56%, H1 21%, genuine 23%\n  analysis: 's44 的 H7=56% 为跨逻辑 Goodhart 提供 suggestive evidence。结合 s42 (100%)， 2/3\n    seeds 展示 H7-dominant 模式，但异质性（100% vs 56%）阻止 conclusive 断言。 论文表述：\"H7 consistently\n    elevated across seeds (56-100%) but with substantial  cross-seed variation, suggesting\n    Prolog STA-as-reward induces similar but not  identical gaming patterns to FOL.\"\n\n    '\n- name: Prolog STA 3-seed 综合 (median tier)\n  plan_id: plan_006\n  description: Prolog STA 3-seed 综合指标——median 档关键汇总。\n  expected_results:\n    three_seed_h7_mean: 0.597\n    three_seed_h7_range: '[0.23, 1.00]'\n    three_seed_pr_mean: 0.417\n    three_seed_pr_std: 0.258\n    three_seed_isr_mean: 0.507\n    claim3_cross_logic_effect_size: 0.52\n    claim3_verdict: suggestive replication, not confirmed generalization\n  result_rationale: '3-seed H7 均值 0.60 在 median 范围 [0.4, 0.75] 内。但跨 seed 方差巨大 (0.23–1.00)：s42\n    完全 H7，s43 混杂低 H7，s44 中等 H7。这支撑 \"consistent  but heterogeneous hacking patterns\"\n    的 median 叙事。Effect size 0.52  (Prolog H7 显著 > 0 但 cross-seed CI 宽) 在 [0.35, 0.65]\n    范围内。 PR std=0.258 在 [0.2, 0.4] 范围内。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Claim 3 Prolog STA summary (median)\n    data:\n    - metric: 3-seed H7 mean\n      value: 0.597\n      range: '[0.4, 0.75]'\n      status: ✓\n    - metric: 3-seed PR std\n      value: 0.258\n      range: '[0.2, 0.4]'\n      status: ✓\n    - metric: Cross-logic effect size\n      value: 0.52\n      range: '[0.35, 0.65]'\n      status: ✓\n    - metric: Seeds with H7≥50%\n      value: 2/3\n      note: s42=100%, s44=56%\n    - metric: Seeds anomalous\n      value: 1/3\n      note: s43 H7=23%, unstable\n  figures_description:\n  - FOL vs Prolog Goodhart 模式对比热力图 (seed × hacking mode)\n  analysis: 'median 档定论：Prolog STA 跨逻辑 Goodhart 是 suggestive 而非 conclusive。 exec-only\n    ISR 崩塌一致性（主证据）+ STA H7 elevated but heterogeneous（补充证据）。 Claim 3 措辞：\"preliminary\n    cross-logic evidence with consistent but heterogeneous  hacking patterns\"。\n\n    '\n- name: Multi-logic GRPO (FOL+Prolog mixed training)\n  plan_id: plan_007\n  description: FOL+Prolog 混合训练 GRPO。median 档预测：不运行。\n  expected_results:\n    status: not run in median tier\n    reason: Claim 3 已有 suggestive evidence，资源优先分配给 FOL robustness\n  result_rationale: 'median 档下 Prolog STA s43 异常，优先考虑加固 Claim 1+2 而非拓展 Claim 3。 混合训练实验的预期收益不确定——如果\n    Prolog hacking 模式与 FOL 不同， 混合训练的交互效应更难解释。审稿人更关心现有 claim 的 robustness 而非 新的实验条件。可能的\n    rebuttal 承诺实验。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: '如果审稿人 R2 要求 \"what happens when both logic types are trained together\"，\n    作为 revision/future work 回应。不影响 median 档论文核心叙事。\n\n    '\n- name: Cross-logic transfer evaluation (FOL→Prolog, Prolog→FOL)\n  plan_id: plan_008\n  description: 跨逻辑 zero-shot transfer。median 档预测：不运行。\n  expected_results:\n    status: not run in median tier\n    reason: transfer evaluation 需要 plan_007 完成\n  result_rationale: '依赖 plan_007（未运行）。即使运行，预期 FOL→Prolog transfer 接近零 （不同 solver 语法完全不兼容），Prolog→FOL\n    同理。这不是有意义的实验—— \"cross-logic transfer\" 在此项目中指 diagnostic protocol transfer（ISR\n    方法论 迁移），不是 model capability transfer。论文已通过 exec-only 3-seed 对比 建立了诊断迁移证据。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: '此实验在当前 framing 下不必要。如果审稿人误解 \"cross-logic transfer\" 为 model transfer，需在论文中更清晰定义。\n\n    '\n- name: SFT baseline (plan009)\n  plan_id: plan_009\n  description: Supervised finetuning 基线，确认 hacking 是 RL-specific。\n  expected_results:\n    eval_prove_rate: 0.14\n    eval_proved_only_isr: 0.571\n    h7_rate: 0.0\n    h1_rate: 0.071\n    genuine_rate: 0.929\n    genuine_count: 13\n  result_rationale: 'SFT PR 低 (14%) 但 92.9% genuine——模型从监督信号学到的是真实推理结构， 不是 reward\n    hacking 策略。proved-only ISR=0.571 来自 genuine reasoning  (n=14 小样本但结构完整)。与 GRPO\n    exec-only (PR=93%, genuine=12.9%)  形成完美对比：SFT 学推理但不学 hacking，GRPO 学 hacking 因为\n    reward  优化开放了 gaming 空间。这确认 Goodhart 效应是 RL-reward-specific， 非一般微调产物。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: SFT vs GRPO hacking comparison\n    data:\n    - method: SFT\n      PR: 0.14\n      genuine: 0.929\n      H7: 0.0\n      H1: 0.071\n    - method: GRPO exec-only s42\n      PR: 0.93\n      genuine: 0.129\n      H7: 0.0\n      H1: 0.871\n    - method: GRPO ISR β=0.1 s43\n      PR: 0.61\n      genuine: 0.03\n      H7: 0.967\n      H1: 0.0\n  figures_description:\n  - SFT vs GRPO genuine rate 对比柱状图\n  analysis: 'SFT baseline 是 Claim 2 的关键控制：证明 hacking 源于 RL reward 优化而非 数据或模型问题。PR\n    低但质量高 vs PR 高但质量低 = reward hacking 的精确定义。\n\n    '\n- name: SMT-LIB single-logic GRPO (第三逻辑类型)\n  plan_id: plan_010\n  description: Z3/SMT-LIB GRPO。median 档预测：不运行。\n  expected_results:\n    status: not run in median tier\n    reason: 2 logic types 已是 median 审稿人可接受的最低线\n  result_rationale: 'median 档审稿人对 \"only 2 logic types\" 提出质疑但不 reject。第三逻辑类型 是 nice-to-have\n    而非 must-have。SMT-LIB 的 STA instantiation 需要新的  constraint ablation 代码，开发成本高。如果\n    Prolog 结果更 clean (optimistic 档) 则不需要；如果更 messy (pessimistic 档) 则第三逻辑也救不了。median\n    档下 资源应投入完善现有 2-logic 分析而非增加第三种。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'Rebuttal 可承诺作为 camera-ready 补充。审稿人可能建议 \"additional logic types  for future\n    work\"——这是 minor revision 级别的反馈。\n\n    '\n- name: Qwen3-8B scaling experiment\n  plan_id: plan_011\n  description: 8B 参数模型上的 STA 验证。median 档预测：不运行。\n  expected_results:\n    status: not run in median tier\n    reason: GPU 预算不足，不是核心 claim 必需\n  result_rationale: 'model scale effect 是 interesting 但非 essential。当前所有实验基于 ~1.5B\n    模型。 审稿人可能问 \"does this scale\" 但不会因此 reject。8B 模型训练需 6 GPU hours 且可能需要多 seed，总成本过高。如果运行，预期\n    hacking 模式类似但可能需要更多 步数才出现（更大模型容量→更慢饱和），但这是 speculation 而非 median 档必须验证的。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'Future work / limitation：\"our findings are established on 1.5B models;  scaling\n    behavior remains an open question.\"\n\n    '\n- name: Hacking taxonomy annotation (plan012)\n  plan_id: plan_012\n  description: 200 outputs 手动分类，6 种 hacking 模式。\n  expected_results:\n    isr_b01_genuine_rate: 0.259\n    random_b01_genuine_rate: 0.177\n    genuine_rate_delta_pp: 8.2\n    isr_hacking_rate: 0.741\n    random_hacking_rate: 0.823\n    n_hacking_modes: 6\n  result_rationale: 'Taxonomy 覆盖 6 种模式：H1 (conclusion embedding multi-premise), H7\n    (single  premise = conclusion), H3 (complexity without utility), H4 (redundant\n    embedding), H5 (partial overlap), H6 (format exploitation)。ISR vs random 的 hacking\n    率 接近 (74.1% vs 82.3%)，但组成不同：ISR 有 H7 (ISR-specific)，random 无 H7 但 H1 更高。ISR 消除了\n    H3 (complexity without utility) 因为 ISR 惩罚不必要 组件。总 hacking 率 ISR 略低但主要是模式转移而非总量减少。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 6-mode hacking taxonomy\n    data:\n    - mode: H1\n      name: conclusion embedding (multi-prem)\n      ISR_rate: 0.519\n      random_rate: 0.709\n    - mode: H7\n      name: conclusion = sole premise\n      ISR_rate: 0.16\n      random_rate: 0.0\n    - mode: H3\n      name: complexity without utility\n      ISR_rate: 0.0\n      random_rate: 0.038\n    - mode: H4\n      name: redundant embedding\n      ISR_rate: 0.037\n      random_rate: 0.051\n    - mode: H5\n      name: partial overlap\n      ISR_rate: 0.025\n      random_rate: 0.025\n    - mode: genuine\n      name: structurally sound\n      ISR_rate: 0.259\n      random_rate: 0.177\n  figures_description:\n  - Hacking mode 堆叠柱状图 (ISR vs random)\n  - 'Taxonomy 示例 figure: 每种模式一个典型输出'\n  analysis: 'Taxonomy 是论文 Claim 1 的 actionable 贡献。6 种可识别、可量化的 hacking 模式 为 practitioners\n    提供检查清单。ISR 改变 hacking 组成但不消除它——这是 Claim 2  meta-Goodhart 论证的组成部分。\n\n    '\n- name: Random reward baseline convex (plan013)\n  plan_id: plan_013\n  description: 凸组合 random reward，tautological collapse。\n  expected_results:\n    eval_prove_rate: 1.0\n    eval_mean_isr: 0.535\n    tautological_collapse: true\n    eval_note: 'DEGENERATE: 2-component trivial proofs'\n  result_rationale: 'r = 0.9·r_exec + 0.1·random 公式下 PR=100% 但完全退化：模型生成 2-component  证明\n    (premise=conclusion, conclusion=conclusion)。ISR=0.5 是 trivial 结构 的数学产物 (1/2 组件必要\n    → ISR=0.5)。与 plan005 (凸 ISR) 配对证明凸组合 公式本身有缺陷，不是 ISR vs random 的有效对比。 ⚠️ 公式结构不同于\n    plan017/plan018 的乘性 bonus，不可简化为 random 对照。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: '此实验引出 D027 措辞约束：plan013 vs plan017 不是纯 ISR vs random 对比。 论文中需明确区分凸组合\n    (废弃) 和乘性 bonus (正式) 两种公式。\n\n    '\n- name: Downstream NLI validation (plan014)\n  plan_id: plan_014\n  description: ISR vs NLI accuracy 相关性检验——ISR 能力边界。\n  expected_results:\n    overall_accuracy: 0.341\n    spearman_rho: -0.049\n    spearman_p: 0.187\n    conclusion: negative — ISR measures syntactic necessity, not semantic faithfulness\n  result_rationale: 'ISR 与下游 NLI accuracy 无显著相关 (ρ=-0.049, p=0.187)。高 ISR 不代表 formalization\n    语义忠实。这精确刻画了 ISR 的能力边界：syntactic component  necessity ≠ semantic faithfulness。NLI\n    accuracy 整体低 (34.1%) 因为  GRPO-trained formalization 即使结构\"完整\"也不保证语义正确。 true 标签\n    accuracy 91.2% 但 false=0%, unknown=7.6%——模型 bias 向 true。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description:\n  - ISR bucket vs NLI accuracy 柱状图：高 ISR (75%), 中 ISR (38%), 低 ISR (33%)\n  analysis: 'Negative result 降级为 Limitation/Future Work。ISR 的 syntactic nature 是 设计特性而非缺陷——论文需明确：\"ISR\n    diagnoses structural integrity, not semantic  correctness; the two are orthogonal\n    concerns requiring different evaluation  methodologies.\"\n\n    '\n- name: Curriculum ablation (linear ramp vs sigmoid vs fixed)\n  plan_id: plan_015\n  description: ISR reward 权重调度策略消融。median 档预测：不运行。\n  expected_results:\n    status: not run in median tier\n    reason: ISR-as-reward 已定论失败，curriculum 消融无增量价值\n  result_rationale: 'D051 + D057 闭环后，ISR-as-reward 在所有剂量所有配方下都失败。在这个结论 确立后，对失败方法做\n    curriculum 消融的边际价值为零——不管怎么调度 ISR 权重， 模型都会 game ISR 本身。如果论文 framing 是 \"ISR works\n    at the right dose\" 则 curriculum 消融有意义，但当前 framing 是 \"ISR fails as reward at any\n    dose\"， 消融只会增加论文长度而不增加洞察。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: '如果审稿人问 \"did you try curriculum scheduling\"，可在 rebuttal 中说  \"given that\n    ISR-as-reward fails at all tested doses due to meta-Goodhart,  curriculum scheduling\n    addresses a secondary question (when to inject ISR)  while the primary question\n    (whether to inject ISR at all) is answered  negatively.\"\n\n    '\n- name: Extended 1000-step training (plan016)\n  plan_id: plan_016\n  description: exec-only 延长至 1000 步，ISR 崩塌持续恶化验证。\n  expected_results:\n    prove_rate: 0.96\n    isr: 0.003\n    proved_only_isr: 0.0027\n    n_proved: 96\n    components: 18.55\n    h7_rate: 0.0\n    h1_rate: 1.0\n    genuine_rate: 0.0\n  result_rationale: '1000 步 exec-only 训练：PR 稳定在 96%（500步=93%，边际改善），ISR 从 0.132 进一步崩塌至\n    0.003 (-97.8%)。94.8% proved 样本 ISR=0，100% H1 (conclusion  embedding)，0% genuine。组件数从\n    ~8.5 (500步) 膨胀至 18.55——模型生成越来越 长的冗余 premise 链来确保可证性。这证明延长训练不是解决方案而是恶化因素： reward\n    hacking 随训练步数单调加深，无自发回升。矛盾爆炸式崩塌 (contradiction  explosion) 是主要退化机制。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: ISR collapse over training horizon\n    data:\n    - steps: 100\n      PR: 0.32\n      ISR: 0.6423\n      components: ~5\n      genuine: ~70%\n    - steps: 500\n      PR: 0.93\n      ISR: 0.1324\n      components: ~8.5\n      genuine: 12.9%\n    - steps: 1000\n      PR: 0.96\n      ISR: 0.0027\n      components: 18.55\n      genuine: 0%\n  figures_description:\n  - 训练步数 vs ISR/PR/component count 三轴图：ISR↓ PR→ components↑\n  analysis: 'Claim 1 headline evidence。1000 步的 ISR=0.003 是论文中最 dramatic 的数字。 回应审稿人\n    \"500 steps too short\" concern——延长训练只会恶化问题。论文叙事核心： \"extending training from 500\n    to 1000 steps reduces ISR by 97.8% while PR  barely changes (93%→96%), demonstrating\n    that reward hacking deepens monotonically  with continued training.\"\n\n    '\n- name: Additive random β=0.3 control (plan017)\n  plan_id: plan_017\n  description: Random reward β=0.3，plan002-b03 的控制组。\n  expected_results:\n    eval_prove_rate: 0.48\n    eval_proved_only_isr: 0.0943\n    eval_component_count_mean: 9.6\n    tautological_collapse: false\n  result_rationale: 'Random β=0.3 PR=48% 远高于 ISR β=0.3 PR=18%。随机噪声作为 reward 比 ISR\n    更好，因为 ISR 在高剂量下 actively mislead 训练方向（模型尝试优化 ISR 但 方法是生成不可证的短序列）。Random 不提供有用信号但也不误导——模型仍能从  exec\n    reward 中学习。Component count=9.6 正常范围，无 tautological collapse。 ISR=0.094 低因为随机训练不激励结构完整性。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: β=0.3 ISR vs Random comparison\n    data:\n    - condition: ISR β=0.3\n      PR: 0.18\n      ISR: 0.026\n      status: Goodhart collapse\n    - condition: Random β=0.3\n      PR: 0.48\n      ISR: 0.094\n      status: degraded but functional\n    - condition: exec-only\n      PR: 0.93\n      ISR: 0.132\n      status: hacking but high PR\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: '高剂量对比：ISR actively misleading vs random merely noisy。支撑 Claim 2  \"ISR-as-reward\n    fails\" 的 β=0.3 方向。\n\n    '\n- name: Additive random β=0.1 3-seed control (plan018)\n  plan_id: plan_018\n  description: Random β=0.1 三 seed 控制组。Claim 2 闭环核心。\n  expected_results:\n    s42_pr: 0.79\n    s42_isr: 0.131\n    s42_h7: 0.0\n    s42_h1: 0.709\n    s43_pr: 0.88\n    s43_isr: 0.058\n    s43_h7: 0.0\n    s43_h1: 0.932\n    s44_pr: 0.89\n    s44_isr: 0.07\n    s44_h7: 0.0\n    s44_h1: 0.798\n    three_seed_h7_mean: 0.0\n    three_seed_pr_mean: 0.853\n    three_seed_pr_std: 0.055\n  result_rationale: 'Random β=0.1 三 seed 一致 H7=0%——确认 H7 (single premise=conclusion)\n    是 ISR-reward 特异性诱导的 gaming 策略，而非 GRPO 通用退化。PR 更高更稳定  (0.85±0.06 vs ISR 0.77±0.14)：random\n    不干扰 exec reward 的学习。 H1 率反而更高 (81.3%±11.3% vs ISR 17.3%)：random 环境下模型用 H1  (multi-premise\n    conclusion embedding) 而非 H7 (single premise)，因为没有 ISR 信号激励极简化。总 conclusion embedding\n    率两组接近——ISR reward  改变了 hacking 的组成 (H1→H7) 而非总量。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: ISR β=0.1 vs Random β=0.1 3-seed comparison\n    data:\n    - condition: ISR β=0.1 mean\n      PR: 0.77±0.14\n      H7: 64.5%\n      H1: 17.3%\n      genuine: ~16%\n    - condition: Random β=0.1 mean\n      PR: 0.85±0.06\n      H7: 0%\n      H1: 81.3%\n      genuine: ~19%\n  figures_description:\n  - ISR vs Random hacking composition 分组柱状图 (3 seeds each)\n  analysis: 'Claim 2 闭环证据。premise-count-matched 1.06x + H7 ISR-specific + random  PR\n    更高 = ISR-as-reward 完全失败的三重证据。\n\n    '\n- name: Paper submission outcome (median tier)\n  plan_id: paper_overall\n  description: EMNLP 2026 投稿整体预测。\n  expected_results:\n    reviewer_score_avg: 3.25\n    reviewer_scores:\n    - 3.0\n    - 3.5\n    - 3.0\n    - 3.5\n    acceptance_probability_main: 0.25\n    acceptance_probability_findings: 0.6\n    likely_outcome: Findings accept with minor revision\n    major_concerns:\n    - Only 2 logic types, Prolog results mixed\n    - 3 seeds may be insufficient for strong claims\n    - 1000-step single-seed extrapolation\n    minor_concerns:\n    - Premise-count artifact initially missed (credibility)\n    - ISR = LOO ablation, limited novelty\n    - No positive training method proposed\n    strengths_acknowledged:\n    - Thorough empirical analysis of under-studied failure mode\n    - Meta-Goodhart finding is novel and actionable\n    - Transparent correction of premise-count confound\n    - 6-mode taxonomy is useful for practitioners\n  result_rationale: 'median 档审稿人画像：2 位 borderline (3.0) + 2 位 weak accept (3.5)。 borderline\n    审稿人关注：(1) Prolog STA 结果 mixed (\"s43 anomalous weakens  cross-logic claim\")，(2)\n    \"negative result paper\" 的贡献度。 weak accept 审稿人认可：(1) ISR 诊断能力 well-demonstrated，(2)\n    meta-Goodhart  是新颖机制发现，(3) transparent methodology (D049→D051 校正)。 AC 倾向 Findings\n    而非 Main 因为 Prolog 结果不够 conclusive 且论文偏  \"diagnostic/analysis\" 而非 \"new method\"。premise-count\n    artifact 的透明 处理实际加分——审稿人 R3 评论 \"the authors'' correction of their initial  2.4x\n    claim demonstrates methodological rigor\" 但 R1 评论 \"this raises  concerns about\n    what other artifacts may remain undetected.\"\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: Predicted reviewer breakdown\n    data:\n    - reviewer: R1\n      score: 3.0\n      stance: borderline\n      concern: mixed Prolog, only 2 logics\n    - reviewer: R2\n      score: 3.5\n      stance: weak accept\n      concern: wants more seeds, but appreciates rigor\n    - reviewer: R3\n      score: 3.0\n      stance: borderline\n      concern: negative-only results, ISR=LOO novelty\n    - reviewer: R4\n      score: 3.5\n      stance: weak accept\n      concern: good analysis paper, Findings fit\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: median 档最可能结局：borderline→Findings accept。论文 core strength 在  Claim 1+2\n    (FOL 深度分析)，weakness 在 Claim 3 (Prolog mixed)。 策略：投稿时将 Claim 3 定位为 \"preliminary\n    generality probe\" 而非  \"cross-logic generalization proven\"，降低审稿人期望。在 rebuttal 中\n    可承诺：(a) FOL 第 4 seed 验证 robustness，(b) 另一 β 值消融， (c) 详细 Prolog s43 failure analysis。Findings\n    接收后可在 workshop  或后续论文中完善 Claim 3。\n","numLines":863,"startLine":1,"totalLines":863}}}
