ducibility**: Is the setup described clearly enough?\n4. **Experimental coverage**: Are there critical missing experiments? Do the experiments actually support the claims?\n5. **Weaknesses in methods/experiments**: What are the main gaps?\n\nProduce a structured review with:\n- Summary (2-3 sentences)\n- Strengths (bulleted)\n- Weaknesses (bulleted)\n- Questions for Authors (numbered)\n- Minor Issues\n- Overall Score (1-6) and Confidence (1-5)\n- One-line recommendation"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01Hts9s1QZKBtk1YDsUoncb6","session_id":"cb7ceeff-4816-4704-b3bd-c692a0f9b846","uuid":"f1d517e4-b831-4e56-8f61-537c16cd2945","timestamp":"2026-05-14T18:14:36.949Z"}
