{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_018dzx3hQHmawcFHWDEyoUgp","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_3/projects/solver-trace-ablation/ROADMAP.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# solver-trace-ablation — Research Dashboard\\\\n\\\\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-14 17:02 UTC | 更新原因: 修正 RUNNING 表：prolog-exec 已全部 DONE，当前跑的是 prolog-STA s43/s44（Reviewer warning 纠正）\\\\n\\\\n## 核心方向\\\\nSTA/ISR 作为 GRPO neurosymbolic formalizer 的**诊断工具** + **Goodhart's Law 案例研究**——检测 reward hacking、量化结构退化、分类退化模式，并展示 ISR 从诊断指标到优化目标的 Goodhart 转折。详见 paper_framing.md。\\\\n\\\\n## 当前进展\\\\n- **阶段**: Research + 审稿进行中 | **DDL**: 2026-05-25（剩 11 天）\\\\n- **实验**: 50+ | Claim 1 ✅ | Claim 2 ✅ (3-seed closed D057) | Claim 3 ⏳ (exec-only 3-seed done, STA RUNNING)\\\\n- **GPU**: 2 × RTX PRO 6000 96GB — cuda:0 plan006-prolog-sta-s44, cuda:1 plan006-prolog-sta-s43\\\\n\\\\n### 核心证据链\\\\n- ✅ **Claim 1 — STA 诊断能力**: ISR 崩塌轨迹 0.6423→0.1324→0.0027; 3-seed exec-only 多模式退化; SFT 零 hacking 对照\\\\n- ✅ **Claim 2 — Goodhart / ISR 无结构优势** (D057 3-seed closed): H7=0% 全 3 seed random 一致 (ISR-specific gaming); Random PR 0.85±0.06 > ISR 0.77±0.14; Genuine rate ~19% vs ~16% 无显著差异; β 剂量效应 (β=0.1 sweet spot vs β=0.3 collapse)\\\\n- ⏳ **Claim 3 — 跨逻辑泛化**: Prolog exec-only 3-seed done (s42 PR=83% ISR=0.031); Prolog STA s42 done (100% H7); STA s43/s44 RUNNING\\\\n- ✅ Hacking taxonomy: ISR β=0.1 genuine 25.9% vs random 17.7%, conclusion embedding 73-79%\\\\n- ✅ plan014 downstream NLI: ISR-NLI ρ=-0.049 n.s.，ISR 能力边界已刻画\\\\n- ✅ plan016 1000步：PR=0.96, ISR=0.003，崩塌持续恶化\\\\n\\\\n## RUNNING\\\\n| 实验 | GPU | 说明 |\\\\n|------|-----|------|\\\\n| plan006-prolog-sta-s44 | cuda:0 | Prolog STA (ISR-as-reward) seed=44 |\\\\n| plan006-prolog-sta-s43 | cuda:1 | Prolog STA (ISR-as-reward) seed=43 |\\\\n\\\\n## 近期任务\\\\n- [x] plan018 3-seed random β=0.1 完成 → Claim 2 数据链闭环 (D057)\\\\n- [x] plan009 SFT baseline → PR=14%, ISR=0.08, 零 hacking\\\\n- [x] plan006-prolog-exec 3-seed 完成 (s42/s43-r3/s44 全部 DONE)\\\\n- [ ] plan006-prolog-sta-s43/s44 完成 → eval → 3-seed Prolog STA 统计\\\\n- [ ] 3-seed 全部出齐 → Table 1 + Table 2 定稿\\\\n- [ ] paper_framing.md 更新纳入最新证据（SFT baseline + Prolog + Claim 2 闭环）\\\\n- [ ] 提交 Paper Agent 启动/Patch 写作\\\\n\\\\n## GPU 预算\\\\n- 本地: 2 × RTX PRO 6000 96GB，两卡满载\\\\n- 已消耗: ~37+ GPU·h\\\\n- 剩余需求: ~6h（Prolog STA s43/s44 ~4h + eval ~2h）\\\\n- DDL 11 天 × 2 卡 × 24h = 528 GPU·h，时间充裕\\\\n\\\\n## 写作约束\\\\n- plan013 vs plan017 公式结构不同，不可简化为\\\\\\\"additive vs convex\\\\\\\"对照 (D027)\\\\n- ISR β=0.1 hacking rate 69.1% (strict定义, D044) vs random 74.7%——论文不可标\\\\\\\"no hacking\\\\\\\"，应标\\\\\\\"lowest hacking rate\\\\\\\"\\\\n- Claim 2 3-seed 已出齐，统计可用 mean±std 正式报告（不再 preliminary）\\\\n\\\\n## 关键决策日志\\\\n\\\\n| ID | 日期 | 摘要 | 关联实验 |\\\\n|----|------|------|----------|\\\\n| D058 | 2026-05-14 | plan016 1000步 hacking 分类完成：H1=100%, Genuine=0%，exe | plan016-extended-1000-s42, plan001-exec-only-s42-r2 |\\\\n| D057 | 2026-05-14 | Claim 2 数据链闭环：3-seed random β=0.1 控制组完成，H7=0% 全 se | plan018-additive-random-b01-s42, plan018-additive-random-b01-s43-r2, plan018-additive-random-b01-s44, plan002-isr-grpo-b01-s42 |\\\\n| D056 | 2026-05-14 | Prolog exec-only 3-seed eval 完成，跨逻辑 ISR 崩塌复现确认 | plan006-prolog-exec-s42, plan006-prolog-exec-s43-r3, plan006-prolog-exec-s44 |\\\\n| D055 | 2026-05-14 | Exec-only s42 确认非 healthy seed：H1=87.1%，conclusion | plan001-s42-r2, plan001-s44 |\\\\n| D054 | 2026-05-14 | D051 定论确认：2.4x ISR 优势完全是 premise-count artifact，pr | plan002-isr-grpo-b01-s42, plan018-random-b01-s42 |\\\\n| D053 | 2026-05-14 | Claim 2 定位回归 pure negative：premise-count-matched 后 | plan002-additive-b01-s42, plan018-additive-random-b01-s42, plan002-additive-b01-s44 |\\\\n| D052 | 2026-05-14 | Claim 2 定论：premise-count-matched 后 ISR vs Random = | plan002-additive-b01-s42, plan018-additive-random-b01-s42, plan002-additive-b01-s44 |\\\\n| D051 | 2026-05-14 | Claim 2 定论：ISR-as-reward 无结构优势，2.4x 差异完全由 premise  | plan002-additive-b01-s42, plan018-additive-random-b01-s42, plan002-additive-b01-s44 |\\\\n| D050 | 2026-05-14 | Genuine ISR 2.4x 差异需控制 premise count confound：ISR  | plan002-additive-b01-s42, plan018-additive-random-b01-s42 |\\\\n| D049 | 2026-05-14 | Claim 2 升级：从\\\\\\\"纯 negative\\\\\\\"改为\\\\\\\"Goodhart 双面性\\\\\\\"——genuine  | plan002-additive-b01-s42, plan018-additive-random-b01-s42, plan018-additive-random-b01-s44 |\\\\n\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 3811, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01HK2HQDGLg8ibeNwXUn3wES","session_id":"cb7ceeff-4816-4704-b3bd-c692a0f9b846","uuid":"ece9ad33-1388-4a3f-82c1-8a4224974f1b","timestamp":"2026-05-14T18:15:15.732Z"}
